                  <span class="home-import-note-page">p. 12</span>
                  <span class="home-import-note-text">"Mean ejection fraction of 35%…"</span>
                </div>
                <div class="home-import-note">
                  <span class="home-import-note-page">p. 47</span>
                  <span class="home-import-note-text">"16% reduction in all-cause mortality…"</span>
                </div>
                <div class="home-import-note">
                  <span class="home-import-note-page">p. 92</span>
                  <span class="home-import-note-text">"Renin-angiotensin blockade reduces afterload…"</span>
                </div>
