          </span>
          <div class="home-audience-eyebrow">Researchers</div>
          <h3 class="home-audience-title">Lab heads, postdocs, scientists.</h3>
          <p class="home-audience-text">
            Track methodologies across studies.  Compare findings.  Build cumulative knowledge across trials and grants without rebuilding the map every time.
          </p>
          <p class="home-audience-query">"Studies using fMRI and a CBT intervention, ranked by sample size."</p>
        </article>

        <article class="home-audience-card home-audience-person">
