          </p>
          <div class="home-pack-tags">
            <span class="home-pack-tag">Web search</span>
            <span class="home-pack-tag">Citation links</span>
            <span class="home-pack-tag">Auto-attribution</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="home-pack home-pack-illustrative">
          <div class="home-pack-head">
            <span class="home-pack-eyebrow">Layered</span>
            <span class="home-pack-count">Your input + generated</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="home-pack-title">Your notes, on top</h3>
          <p class="home-pack-text">
